1. Add fullforwardshadows. Without it a surface shader receives shadows only from the main directional light in ForwardBase. The night scene's only realtime shadow comes from the flashlight or the last-lit scene lamp, and those are drawn in ForwardAdd. So without it, light would leak onto tape that sits behind a post or a case, unlike the Standard materials around it.

